{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國在一年一度的大學修學能力考試，即「修能」，當天採取了極為罕見的反作弊措施：當局在考試開始前向全國手機用户發出最高級別的緊急警報。結果顯示，這一做法確實奏效，首輪警報便發現22名考生未按要求上交手機。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587288.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:43:57.626450+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:16.097146+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:16.097146+00:00","content_hash":"2b4e6024d7d57c64eb783fffa9dd2d51a0d1dfc318c8e859df9487190650d42d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}